body:
I have never seen such a bad banking application ,this has to be the worst bank application developed;

It’s a waste of time and contains unnecessary steps ,

Whoever developed this application for the the bank clearly never developed a user friendly system before I don’t think he even understand the meaning of the term”user friendly “!

When I started to use the new application, I faced number of performance issues:
Very slow login;
Crashes caused necessity to restart my phone;
I could not complete any transaction online ;
Difficulty with Face ID activation 

Issues look partly resolved after my call to customer support
